.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-05/evaluation/iter1/codex/consistency.md:8:Evidence: `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/design/session-lifecycle-worktree-boundaries.md:45` says row 5.5 creates the worktree and stamps `session.json.git.worktreePath`; `:84`, `:91`, and `:112` repeat row-5.5/P2/stamping claims. The actual Step 1 table has row 5 create the worktree and hold the path in-turn, row 5.5 initialize `state.json`, and row 6 stamp `session.json.git.worktreePath` (`.claude/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md:102`, `:103`, `:104`). The direct-mode and smoke-test prose also name row 5, not row 5.5 (`.claude/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md:109`, `:120`, `:134`). `git/SKILL.md` still contains stale row-5.5 wording at `.claude/skills/git/SKILL.md:155`, which conflicts with orchestration.
